\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (G) node[midway,right] {$12$};
\draw[dashed,->] (G) -- (0,16) node[above] {$N$};
\draw (0,4) arc[start angle=90,end angle=112.62,radius=4];
\path (-1.2,5.5) node {$\theta$};
\path (O) node[below] {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The boat steers west of north.

$\begin{aligned}\tan\theta&=\frac{5}{12}\\\theta&\approx22.62^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}\text{Bearing}&=360^{\circ}-\tan^{-1}\left(\frac{5}{12}\right)\\&\approx337^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

The bank velocity is $12\underset{\sim}{j}$ km/h, so the resulting speed is $12$ km/h.

